<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jŭvencŭlus</span></b> , a,
		um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj.
				dim.</i> [juvenca], <i>young</i> (eccl. Lat.),
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Monog. 13</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viduae,</span>”
				<i>young widows</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			: bos, Ambros. de Tob. § 25; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Psa.
				67, 26</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> As <i>subst</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jŭvencŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m., <i>a young man</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 2, 16</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Ambros. Apol. Dav. 3,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A young bullock</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Jer.
				31, 18</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jŭvencŭla</span></b> , ae, <i>a young girl</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Psa.
				68, 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Jud.
				9</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1 Tim.
				5, 2</span></i> al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
